MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7182206,"initDialog":718220601,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[221101],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":71822,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":718220601,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":3814231354,"text":"We're finally here... That journey would have been tough enough even without those monsters...","nextNodeIds":[718220602]},{"nodeId":718220602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":1557326330,"text":"Hmm... There doesn't seem to be anything special about the terrain here...","nextNodeIds":[718220603]},{"nodeId":718220603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":1903147162,"text":"Huh? What's this in the tree... Oh, it's a Xiao Lantern...","nextNodeIds":[718220604]},{"nodeId":718220604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":636838530,"text":"Why would there be a Xiao Lantern here? Did someone come here to pay their respects to the deceased adeptus?","nextNodeIds":[718220605]},{"nodeId":718220605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":4205212154,"text":"There's something written here...","nextNodeIds":[718220606]},{"nodeId":718220606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":1045445666,"text":"\"May all the world be at peace.\"","nextNodeIds":[718220607,718220608]},{"nodeId":718220607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1497516586,"text":"A magnificent wish.","nextNodeIds":[718220609]},{"nodeId":718220609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":1968937114,"text":"Indeed. But this wish... How should I put it... It seems a little too magnificent. This seems neither like a wish, nor a way of paying respects.","nextNodeIds":[718220610]},{"nodeId":718220610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":3627281386,"text":"It seems more like a wish that one of those adepti of legend might make.","nextNodeIds":[718220611]},{"nodeId":718220611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":1869858538,"text":"I wonder, who would write such a wish onto a Xiao Lantern? How strange...","nextNodeIds":[718220612]},{"nodeId":718220612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":344998746,"text":"Regardless, it seems that at least someone remembered to put a Xiao Lantern up here. That adeptus should be quite pleased.","nextNodeIds":[718220613]},{"nodeId":718220613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":3849448418,"text":"Thank you for accompanying me all this way. I'd like to stay here and do a bit more research...","nextNodeIds":[718220614]},{"nodeId":718220614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":2443326570,"text":"Ah, yes. This is for you. Consider it thanks for your help.","nextNodeIds":[718220615]},{"nodeId":718220615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":221101,"speakerName":"Soraya","textMapHash":2565210746,"text":"*sigh* Liyue has so many legends, and yet my research has seen no progress made at all...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":718220608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":692196706,"text":"It doesn't sound like this person was here to pay respects...","nextNodeIds":[718220609]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7182206,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDL